  "Answer": {
    "Title": "Add store_test_results and store_artifacts steps",
    "Explanation": [
      "The run step produces the results file, as the log shows 'Wrote ~/project/results/test_results.xml'. The job is still red because the command ends with `exit 1`, which CircleCI reports as exit code 1. The config has no `store_test_results` step, so nothing appears in the Tests tab. It also has no `store_artifacts` step, so nothing is uploaded as an artifact. Removing `exit 1` alone would make the job green but would not upload anything, and adding only one of the two steps meets only half the requirement. The fix is to add both steps after the test run: `- store_test_results: path: ~/project/results` and `- store_artifacts: path: ~/project/results/test_results.xml`. Because the run step currently exits 1, both steps need `when: always` so they still execute after the failure. Alternatively, remove the deliberate `exit 1` so they run normally."
