      "    path: ~/project/results",
      "    when: always",
      "",
      "This makes the JUnit XML appear in the Test Summary and also uploads the file as an artifact for later inspection. Note: if you instead suppress the failing exit (e.g. run tests || true) the subsequent store steps would run without needing when: always, but that will make the job appear green even if tests failed. Using when: always keeps the job failing while still capturing results and artifacts."
